==English==

===Definition===
Not corresponding; disagreeing; made up of diverse or discordant elements; unsuited to the surrounding or setting.

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|en-us-incongruous.ogg|Audio (US)}}
{{rfp}}

===Etymology===
From {{L.}} {{term|incongruus|lang=la}}, from {{term|in-|lang=la||not}} + {{term|lang=la|congruus||congruent}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

#: ''The old camper looked a bit '''incongruous''' in an upscale neighborhood, but he enjoyed traveling in it.''

====Related terms====
